WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
The live SciFact Evidence Inspector is ready for a scientific claim.

00:07.000 --> 00:28.000
The claim is entered: “Side effects associated with antidepressants increase the risk of stroke.”

00:28.000 --> 00:41.000
The existing retrieval and whole-document context defaults submit a live request. Eight seconds of unchanged waiting frames from the source recording were removed between 00:39 and 00:47.

00:41.000 --> 01:02.000
The local Qwen model returns a qualified answer, its active strategies, parent-document citations, and an insufficient-evidence conclusion for the claim’s causal wording.

01:02.000 --> 01:40.800
A citation opens the supplied parent-document evidence, including its document identity and complete abstract text.
